{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "ba933f8a0f928720484c4a23afeb91754ff71f3bb43100e0a912c25e429f680c", "ja": "私たちがイメージモデル！", "zh": "我们是形象模特儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7bcbb27709226c781a66453e35b6f0ae4f8c07ab4906cc80ccded2b877dee384", "ja": "少女漫画雑誌『りるきゃん』のイメージ\nモデルに選ばれた翼、茜、可憐。何かと\n及び腰な可憐も翼と茜に背中を押され、\n目指すは夢見る女の子達のファッション\nリーダー。そして、恋愛番長……！", "zh": "翼、茜、可怜被选为少女漫画杂志\n《莉露甜心》的形象模特儿。\n可怜虽然感到退缩，但在翼与茜的鼓励之下，\n三人一同立志成为怀梦少女的\n时尚教主，以及恋爱高手……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e53d99064074cd8b9c0e6afcd04238124119e7f044b88704c19567ef73d12f58", "ja": "（今の少女漫画はこんな感じなんだな。これを読めば、\nアイドル達と共通の話題ができるかもしれない）", "zh": "（原来现在的少女漫画是这种感觉。\n看过之后，也许跟偶像们之间也能有共同话题了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1001_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0055a82f62ef1c346fe93023dfc176075a601825b9baa92afcab745b4c3ae1b6", "ja": "{$P$}さん、おはようございま～す♪\n……あれ？　それ、『りるきゃん』じゃないですか～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，早安～♪\n……咦？那本不是《莉露甜心》吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a48361c6ea5085886987226b8ceb7bfa3c1ddea91a81248e9ab946bd98300f5d", "ja": "翼、『りるきゃん』を知ってるのか？", "zh": "翼，你看过《莉露甜心》吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e98b33d0f806c741b6a4c9cdda118ab96c44ddd2bf5ea56b54e1c4db04b24ff0", "ja": "当然ですよ～。『りるきゃん』を読んでないとか、\n流行に乗り遅れちゃいますよ！", "zh": "那当然啊～不看《莉露甜心》，\n要怎么跟上流行呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7a13b88967f8c2588f7acbde69987b9f62eefceab9d9fb05d78e222ed01a4df0", "ja": "ファッションのページがいっぱいあるし、\n漫画も続きが気になるし……。", "zh": "里面介绍很多流行时尚，\n漫画也让人想一直看下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "54036b358714d133e96a8d460a220da0b10cbf99d302766d637994ee3f7ed4eb", "ja": "あと、ふろくが毎回カワイイから、\nクラスの女子はみんな買ってます！", "zh": "还有，每次的附录都很可爱，\n班上的女生都会买喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b788214002dc8808f6e571d600278baf7572607ef45eecc443c0861e4d5dc037", "ja": "へえ、本当に売れてるんだな。\nそれなら話は早い。茜と可憐もいるな？", "zh": "这样啊，看来真的很畅销呢。\n那事情就简单了，茜和可怜也来了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "e2bc600057e645bff83f93cb6059807551fa49feec647bed38e416d33bf4e5cd", "ja": "は～い、{$P$}ちゃん！\nカワイイ茜ちゃんに、何のご用かな？", "zh": "来了～小{$P$}！\n你找可爱的小茜有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "baae9589abc48c3752a09d785563a35e08e1e1b6fbf074ac7b3e525c22612d80", "ja": "わ、私、何かしてしまったんでしょうか……。\nもしかして、この前の公演のダメ出し……とか……。", "zh": "是、是不是我犯了什么错呢……？\n该不会，是之前的公演……需要改进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "683e4804ce3723b41d4e763b46cf08abc06680874f7991ccc08c150aad03957d", "ja": "いや、違うよ。\n3人に、新しい仕事の話だ。", "zh": "不对，不是的。\n今天要来谈你们三个人的新工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ab378b60d71f54931dc644cab9dc3d5b1e98fec8f2c62ed9b75bf5f50eedff43", "ja": "翼、茜、可憐の3人が、この少女漫画雑誌\n『りるきゃん』のイメージモデルに選ばれたんだ。", "zh": "翼、茜、可怜，你们雀屏中选，将要担任\n《莉露甜心》这本少女漫画杂志的形象模特儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f6ef36fb8cf1a5fecda10a5b71583bd4c6269fbad31aa5ceab40fd6f0f88992e", "ja": "これから『りるきゃん』のグラビア撮影とか、\nCM撮影をやってもらうことになりそうだ。", "zh": "之后会拍摄写真照刊登在《莉露甜心》上，\n应该也会拍摄广告。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "2dcff8097f114ac4dd11169f52ca40c7f16a068695db4a8f5446a32908a64db7", "ja": "わ、私たちが……。", "zh": "我、我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d519657a60e9f827bd2877bd61db665683f7055fa2b6a49fa4e7e55fb6fa3def", "ja": "『りるきゃん』のモデルですか！？\nそれに、CM撮影もするの～！？", "zh": "担任《莉露甜心》的模特儿！？\n而且还要拍广告～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "c7b27dac0adfe67aa0e8b26d2ca9e47581370848629c23c5740b32000f1e2902", "ja": "ハイ来た！　来ちゃったね！\nファッションリーダー茜ちゃんに相応しいお仕事が！", "zh": "来啦！终于来啦！\n适合时尚教主小茜的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9c74af0e60d62d1997d15953dc7228491c2ac850754d6b2d10ed47ba766655c0", "ja": "あっ、茜ちゃんずる～い！　わたしだって、\nオシャレにはちょっとうるさいですよ～。", "zh": "啊！小茜太狡猾了～！\n人家对流行打扮也是很讲究的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "698d15c5c32e77ed684c47a83b680c6b438c8c1071a5c4a334fb37431b59702a", "ja": "す、すみません……。\n私は……あんまり……。", "zh": "对、对不起……\n这方面……我不太……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4208b82f75342199768b054199a46e50cb6e86f8bebe3a971fae78fd020e6486", "ja": "もう！　可憐さんは、\nすぐそうやって引っこんじゃうんだから～！", "zh": "真是的！\n可怜老是动不动就退缩～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "9e566d5e05471217b683a8c2519ddc23729be6371bbe1dd77f4feee5c1a4fc95", "ja": "そうだよ、可憐ちゃん！　こういう時こそ、\nドーンと出ていかなきゃダメだよ、ドーンと！", "zh": "对啊，小可怜！有这种机会，\n要好好表现才行啊，好好表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "7959cf34396865c9cb22c475e9ba5657ef7e47e4caeca9a49599f368b711864c", "ja": "ええっ！？\nで、でも、私なんて地味だし……。", "zh": "什么！？\n可、可是，像我这么不起眼的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cd7ce8885d9d5ad7cf29c38ca9fd62ccd30cdd5735d5d28fdd2e27f737f39143", "ja": "そんなコトないですよ！　可憐さん、\nいつもステキな服着てると思うけどな～。", "zh": "才没那回事呢！可怜，\n我觉得你的穿搭都很棒耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "339595c00d9be9e1c76a4e9d8bfbf2fc9ec990c20780f9db63a954e780491c78", "ja": "こ、これは……。服装だけでも、すこしは\n派手にしないと……埋もれちゃうから……。", "zh": "那、那是因为……我至少服装要穿得显眼一点……\n不然会黯淡无光的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "692efac1993ce7b8e9463c96fe360ee9c864029a276a70e0f4bbb88aabfde018", "ja": "でも、『りるきゃん』のモデルかぁ……\nちょっと、憧れちゃうな……♪", "zh": "不过，《莉露甜心》的模特儿吗……\n我的确有点憧憬呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "d7f99aad5f45266ad75dcde64837decd243d710565192a17b4ef3196699a953b", "ja": "いいねいいね！\nそうこなくっちゃね！", "zh": "很好很好！\n这样就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a28218092a91705895846c5fbe6bb7cbdff44d2cdfdcd79c258515313a10369f", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　可憐さんも、\nイメージモデルがんばるって！　やったね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n可怜说她也会努力担任形象模特儿耶！太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "4f2255df20c33ebe1aeaa20a7657e2f80203c7505014dbec4d6b0f8f2b06cbf1", "ja": "ええっ！？　わ、私、そんな……。", "zh": "什么！？我、我并没有那么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "da1c9724ea2e99e90a1523b856fea3c3845f279599cd73f8e97761e2853db5a4", "ja": "ははは。いいじゃないか、可憐。\nせっかくの機会だし、何事もチャレンジだぞ！", "zh": "哈哈哈，不错啊，可怜。\n机会难得，凡事都要挑战看看啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "59aee49ff006424eb2484af1789fd61d3c4f024e7d5c19e32a04977c4d50baff", "ja": "{$P$}さん……うう、\nわ、わかりました……。自信はありませんけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……呜呜，\n我、我明白了……虽然我没什么自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "995c089f9586efeb83ca2d6abd8f394009489b381d25f701e5dc6c6235bb1976", "ja": "ここは茜ちゃんたち3人が、夢見る女の子の\nファッションリーダーとして、そして恋愛番長として！", "zh": "在场的小茜等三位偶像，\n将作为怀梦女孩的时尚教主，以及恋爱高手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "a00806cc87809e3967870a6cdd92749c228bf245e240c17d185ffdec83fed767", "ja": "その名を轟かせようじゃないか～っ！", "zh": "名扬天下～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "e8c9c039ac5ab175753b08a84d432395e52d411a191253b109438c09a1196554", "ja": "ふ、ファッションリーダー……。", "zh": "时、时尚教主……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1bd0030347e911c06037df7c214b74d8f04cb821bbc59c46e59b8a3dd2879995", "ja": "恋愛番長！？", "zh": "恋爱高手！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "29e3a3a22bb323f0c84c999ee96015a7bc41a37b19bf7e77c30bf0f63dcff86b", "ja": "そうだよ翼ちゃん、可憐ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんから、どんどんセンスを盗んでいいからね！", "zh": "没错，小翼、小可怜！\n你们可以尽量从小茜身上多学几招！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "4c2d368a0c468da2669dc73a948ff55359d6a67105987df85cf03e332b311f60", "ja": "うぅ……が、がんばります……。", "zh": "呜呜……我、我会加油的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1037_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a99b095941c0e6631435701ed24d7f8edef420ad8691303e2e6eb73449516178", "ja": "はーい♪　わたしも、がんばっちゃいまーす♪", "zh": "好──♪我也会加油喔──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "a5e97bca6ee0371492edae5fcb565517ac5921e075ef971e9f936619c682ba17", "ja": "（人気の雑誌のイメージモデルの仕事とあって、\n3人のモチベーションも高いようだ）", "zh": "（因为要担任畅销杂志的形象模特儿，\n她们三人都干劲十足。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "ce75579096c5e1fc88234f16e44c287d17f405a6187f1a7011396d552abab62c", "ja": "（俺が一番『りるきゃん』のことを知らないな……。\nこれからは通勤中に『りるきゃん』を読む事にするか）", "zh": "（反观我对《莉露甜心》最不熟悉……\n以后通勤时就来看《莉露甜心》吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
